tes a script without any effort or understanding, claiming it as their own. What I’m doing is modifying the script by making actual changes, adding new functionality, and improving it based on my own needs. I’ve been working with Lua for over 6 years, so I know what I’m doing and I always ensure the code I use is adapted and improved through my own skills.","createdAt":"2024-09-16T07:15:21.130Z","edited":true,"likeCount":1,"liked":false,"disliked":false},{"_id":"66e7db6be2eb91d2a73299d5","commentBy":{"_id":"65a51550b8a73bbbfce89021","username":"scarletdev","verified":false,"role":"user","profilePicture":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/10717283c51603280edc079694ea364e3d477a6939a6f594010d79fa7cdea83c.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/65a51550b8a73bbbfce89021-1727685857034.png"},"createdAt":"2024-01-15T11:21:52.088Z","lastActive":"2024-10-01T11:22:21.133Z","status":"offline","id":"65a51550b8a73bbbfce89021","profile":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/10717283c51603280edc079694ea364e3d477a6939a6f594010d79fa7cdea83c.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/65a51550b8a73bbbfce89021-1727685857034.png"}},"text":"Also, I think you should consider making the UI u*fuscated anyway. If someone really wants to skid, they'll find a way no matter what. In the end, game is game, and it's better to focus on improving your content rather than worrying about every possible skidder. Plus, obfuscating can sometimes cause more issues than it's worth.","createdAt":"2024-09-16T07:16:59.001Z","edited":true,"likeCount":1,"liked":false,"disliked":false},{"_id":"68d3e49aeeff06b81bf3bbad","commentBy":{"_id":"6738adc3620b49b6cee7cfd3","username":"ich_bin_fishy_ish","verified":false,"role":"user","profilePicture":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/f7ad6214cc38ed173a7d6ea257a7f2287d5881b417172eb4e39f27e72ba23ced.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/6738adc3620b49b6cee7cfd3-1740850959114.png"},"createdAt":"2024-11-16T14:35:47.447Z","lastActive":"2025-10-18